{"id":"fa78956f6600ab98","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-lem-cts.md","title":"Monotone Limit Bound","display":"lem-cts — Monotone Limit Bound","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-cts","aliases":["58-lem-cts"],"display":"lem-cts — Monotone Limit Bound","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-increasing.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-cts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-cts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-cts — Monotone Limit Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a725410f88e5842e\" href=\"?note=a725410f88e5842e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md\">../batch12/58-df-increasing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\eta\">\\(\\theta,\\eta\\)</span> (ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\theta\\to\\eta\">\\(f:\\theta\\to\\eta\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\theta\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\theta\\)</span> (limit ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)\\)</span> (strictly increasing predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a725410f88e5842e\" href=\"?note=a725410f88e5842e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md\">../batch12/58-df-increasing.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cts}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}f(\\beta)\\leq f(\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cts}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}f(\\beta)\\leq f(\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Monotonicity gives only the displayed upper bound.</li>\n<li>Equality requires the additional continuity condition\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\alpha)=\\sup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}f(\\beta)\">\\(f(\\alpha)=\\sup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}f(\\beta)\\)</span>; it does not follow from increasingness alone.</li>\n<li>Because the values are ordinals, their supremum is their union; the assertion now uses that canonical set operation rather than an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\">\\(\\sup\\)</span> operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md","status":"resolved","id":"a725410f88e5842e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-increasing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\theta\\to\\eta$ (function, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\theta$ (limit ordinal, see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-increasing.md","status":"resolved","id":"a725410f88e5842e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)$ (strictly increasing predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-increasing.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)$ (limit-ordinal predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta,\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\theta\\to\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cts}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Increasing}_S(f,\\theta,\\eta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}f(\\beta)\\leq f(\\alpha)","display":true},{"tex":"f(\\alpha)=\\sup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}f(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup","display":false}],"bytes":1359,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3887","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-lem-cts.md|58-lem-cts]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","a725410f88e5842e","81cabbac7fa4d75d"]}